# stepped_ring.tlspr, a stepped ring turned by a lathe, hollowed open at
# the narrow part's outer side, picked with the mouse: the side meets the
# step at an inside corner, where the inside steps along the step's
# plane. The same as path_shell_step.go makes
# (TestPathEquivalence/shell_step).
file $testdata/ui/stepped_ring.tlspr
menu File|Open...
view default
click-face face 12 of g003-lathe
menu Features|Shell Solid
